emulation: the rounded compile rewrites the accumulation into the target: true
emulation: every value rounds bitwise as cvt.rna.tf32.f32 does: true
emulation: the plain compile leaves some value unrounded (the inputs discriminate): true
emulation: the sweep holds ties where ties-to-even rounds the other way: true
hardware: at least one seed executes tensorized with its reference rounded to tf32: true
hardware: every executed seed matches its reference bitwise: true
hardware: no seed fails to reach its segment, is unjudged, or raises: true
hardware control: against the plain reference, some tensorized seed differs: true
